        "excerpt": "  # HONEST after the 2026 correction sequence: (1) FX 300 -> 333.79; (2) the ERA5-fitted\n  # Weibull re-baseline (declared A=8.32/k=2.1 -> fitted 8.199/2.665, AEP 483.6 -> 473.8 GWh);\n  # (3) the 2026-06 project-discounting fix (audit finding 2.0): operating year 1 had been\n  # discounted at t=0, ignoring the 2-year construction lag, pulling the operating stream\n  # forward one period (fixed -> project IRR 5.43%); (4) the 2026-06 DEGRADATION re-baseline\n  # (`project.degradation` 0.005 was read as 0.005%/yr ~ zero; corrected to honest 0.5%/yr\n  # aging -> project IRR 5.43% -> 5.05%), and the interest-tax-shield re-baseline that lifted\n  # equity IRR to +2.42%; (5) the 2026-06-28 FX-DRIFT re-baseline (fx.annual_depr 3% -> 5.89%,\n  # data-derived BIS 2005-2026 long-run LKR depreciation): project IRR 5.05% -> 2.75%, equity\n  # IRR +2.42% -> -0.46%, NPV -$32.3M -> -$53.3M; (6) the 2026-06-28 AEP OVER-PREDICTION\n  # HAIRCUT (2.0%, resource.uncertainty.p50_haircut_pct): modelled net P50 473.8 -> bankable\n  # 464.3 GWh (CF 0.339 -> 0.332), corroborated by the Envision EN220 EIA P50 464.5 (the OEM's\n  # own pre-construction EYA — bounds model-vs-EYA drift, not EYA-vs-operations bias; #654);\n  # and (7) the 2026-06-28 PR-A group-C #36 tax/levy re-baseline: remove the non-statutory\n  # success-fee/env-surcharge levies (#43, +CFADS ~1.5% -> project IRR 2.50% -> 2.68%, NPV\n  # -$56.1M -> -$54.0M), add the SL 15% dividend WHT (#81) and capitalize debt IDC into the\n  # depreciable base (#36/#75) — both equity-path only, netting equity IRR -1.00% -> -1.93%\n  # (the dividend WHT dominates the IDC shield gain); and (8) the 2026-06-28 PR-B group-C #3\n  # UIP LKR DEBT RATE: Financing_Terms.rates.lkr 8% -> UIP-implied 13.39% (USD 7.5% + the same\n  # 5.89% data-derived LKR drift) — the 8% implied a concessional facility; this is the\n  # market-rate assumption (pending a real LKR term-sheet). projIRR UNCHANGED (unlevered); the\n  # costlier LKR tranche lifts WACC 8.11% -> 9.83%, deepens NPV -$54.0M -> -$65.5M, takes equity\n  # IRR -1.93% -> -4.86%, and de-levers the DSCR-solved gearing 0.588 -> ~0.45; and (9) the\n  # 2026-07-04 #737 CREDIT-SUPPORT FEES: guarantee 75 bps + PRI 100 bps per year on the\n  # OUTSTANDING senior debt (Financing_Terms.fees), charged senior to debt service\n  # (reduces CFADS), ops-period only, tax-deductible, and sized INSIDE the DSCR sculpt —\n  # the gearing solve holds the 1.30 per-period target fee-inclusively, de-levering\n  # 0.45 -> 0.4275 (debt $71.8M -> $68.2M). CFADS $202.3M -> $191.2M (-5.5%), project IRR\n  # 2.68% -> 2.03%, equity IRR -4.86% -> -4.99%, NPV -$65.5M -> -$70.9M (WACC 9.83% ->\n  # 9.94%, more equity in the stack). NOTE the conservative per-year covenant table reads\n  # year 1 at ~1.288 (it folds the orphaned half-year bridge service into year 1, and the\n  # fee consumed the pre-fee slack there); the per-period series holds 1.30 everywhere.\n  # A real blended-finance deal pays these fees; the fee-free case was overstating\n  # coverage and returns. And (10) the 2026-07-05 #738 IMPORT LEVIES + INDIRECT-TAX\n  # re-baseline — TWO OPPOSING moves in one atomic flip: (a) SSCL-on-revenue REVERSED\n  # 2.5% -> 0 (the levy WAS being charged at the EBITDA line; the SSCL Act First\n  # Schedule exempts non-CEB electricity supply — see the statutory: block note) — on\n  # its own +CFADS/+IRR (projIRR 2.03% -> 2.33%, NPV -70.9 -> -68.3M); and (b) import\n  # levies ON at the PRUDENT posture (taxes_indirect: PAL 5% + import-SSCL 2.5% PAID\n  # on the 0.69 imported share = $8.2593M duties capitalized; capex VAT relieved via\n  # BOI §17/bonded; 18% unrecoverable VAT on O&M) — which DOMINATES: net projIRR\n  # 2.03% -> 1.46%, equity IRR -4.99% -> -5.84%, NPV -$70.9M -> -$79.3M, CFADS\n  # $191.22M -> $191.11M, gross financed capex $159.6M -> $167.86M ($1,051.75/kW),\n  # DSCR-solved gearing 0.4275 -> 0.41 (debt $68.23M -> $68.82M on the grossed\n  # base). The sculpt still holds the 1.30 PER-PERIOD floor; the #790 fold headline\n  # eases 1.2884 -> 1.2857 (still exactly 1 equity-lockup year).\n  # Net current canonical: project IRR 1.46% (BELOW the ~9.9% WACC), equity IRR -5.84% (NEGATIVE),\n  # NPV -$79.3M, DSCR-solved gearing 0.41. The project is value-destructive, honestly so.\n  # (Equity bears the fee net of the cash-sweep interaction: the sweep headroom is also\n  #  fee-netted, so the un-swept residual grows — reported as a balloon covenant breach.)"
